    # Index 24 - Jan 25
    {"verse": "Psalm 37:4", "text": "Delight yourself in the Lord, and he will give you the desires of your heart.", "reflection": "As we delight in God, our desires begin to align with His. He shapes our hearts to want what He wants to give. True satisfaction comes from finding our joy in Him first.", "prayer": "Ask God to be your greatest delight and to shape your desires to match His will.", "application": "How can you cultivate deeper delight in God rather than in circumstances or possessions?"},
