    # Index 69 - Mar 10
    {"verse": "John 10:10", "text": "The thief comes only to steal and kill and destroy. I came that they may have life and have it abundantly.", "reflection": "Jesus came to bring abundance, not scarcity. Abundant life is not about material wealth but about spiritual fullness — purpose, peace, love, and deep connection with God.", "prayer": "Ask Jesus to reveal what abundant life looks like for you in this season.", "application": "What is one way you can embrace the abundant life Jesus offers rather than settling for mere survival?"},
    # Index 70 - Mar 11
    {"verse": "Proverbs 4:23", "text": "Keep your heart with all vigilance, for from it flow the springs of life.", "reflection": "What fills your heart shapes everything else — your words, your choices, your relationships. Guarding your heart is not about building walls but about carefully choosing what you allow to influence your inner life.", "prayer": "Pray for discernment to guard your heart from influences that lead you away from God.", "application": "How can you guard your heart today by being intentional about what you allow to influence your thoughts and emotions?"},
    # Index 71 - Mar 12
