    # Index 77 - Mar 18
    {"verse": "2 Corinthians 13:14", "text": "The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ and the love of God and the fellowship of the Holy Spirit be with you all.", "reflection": "This apostolic blessing captures the fullness of God's gift to us: grace through Christ, love from the Father, and fellowship with the Spirit. We lack nothing when we are in His presence.", "prayer": "Ask God to make the grace of Christ, the love of the Father, and the fellowship of the Spirit real to you today.", "application": "What is one way you can be more aware of the Holy Spirit's fellowship throughout your daily activities?"},
