    # Index 92 - Apr 2
    {"verse": "1 Corinthians 15:55-57", "text": "O death, where is your victory? O death, where is your sting? The sting of death is sin, and the power of sin is the law. But thanks be to God, who gives us the victory through our Lord Jesus Christ.", "reflection": "Death's sting has been removed. Through Christ, we can face even our deepest fears with triumphant hope. The grave is not the end; it is the doorway to eternal life.", "prayer": "Thank God for the victory over death and sin that is yours through Jesus Christ.", "application": "What is one way you can face a fear about the future with the confidence of resurrection hope?"},
    # Index 93 - Apr 3
