    # Index 100 - Apr 10
    {"verse": "John 11:25-26", "text": "Jesus said to her, I am the resurrection and the life. Whoever believes in me, though he die, yet shall he live, and everyone who lives and believes in me shall never die. Do you believe this?", "reflection": "Jesus does not merely give resurrection; He is the resurrection. In Him, death is not the end but a doorway. His question to Martha echoes to us: Do you believe this?", "prayer": "Affirm your belief that Jesus is the resurrection and the life, and ask Him to deepen that faith.", "application": "How can you answer Jesus' question 'Do you believe this?' with your life today, not just your words?"},
